Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Removes the right-click entry written by the 2023 hand-rolled setup
; (context-reg.reg in this folder). Requires administrator rights.
; You do not need this if you installed PDFCROP with the installer while
; running it elevated — that already cleans the key up.

[-HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\SystemFileAssociations\.pdf\shell\Item0]
